# Competition data. Never commit: redistributing it to anyone who has not
# accepted the rules is a rules violation.
# NOTE: .gitignore has no inline comments - a "#" mid-line becomes part of the
# pattern and silently matches nothing. Keep every comment on its own line.
data/
logs/
